targets (ADR-002 single source tree). `apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/Charging/` is
NOT a compiled source root in project.yml; placing the file there would produce
dead, uncompiled code. This is a faithful interpretation of the artifact's intent
("the Charging feature directory"), not scope narrowing.

